   "module_16730315758341": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Hey {{ contact.firstname }},</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Thank you for choosing<em> </em><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>! Now let us introduce you to</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> <em><span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span></em></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">.</span> We appreciate your partnership and will work every day for you and your patients. Our mission is to help people live healthier lives. Through our resources and your partnership you can count on us to provide educational content, marketing materials, and doctor-formulated supplements.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">We know it can be overwhelming to jump right into everything we offer. To start your journey with us, I'd like you to please be sure to use this email as a guide. Pin it, save it, and do whatever you need to do to make it easy to come back to. It is chock full of information that will be helpful!&nbsp;</span></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
