     },
     "html": "<h2><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Check Out the Resource Library!</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Next up, let's talk about the wealth of resources you have available! There is a good chance you might have seen this before you signed up, but it never hurts to get a refresher. From educational content to materials for your patients, all of our resources serve to enhance your practice.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Here are links to the most popular topics:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\"><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" style=\"color: #76bc43;\" rel=\"noopener\">Whitepapers &amp; Guides</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Marketing Materials</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Educational CE Modules</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Supplement Product Guide</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul></ul>",
     "module_id": 1155639
