      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<h2 style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Spread the Word About Your New Offerings!</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Being part of the <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> team means you can access a wide variety of rigorously tested supplements that use only the highest-quality ingredients. Our inventory covers a diverse range of options so that you can meet all your patients' needs. Sometimes, spreading the word is all you need to do to get the conversation started. We created a few \"posts\" that you can use to get the word out. Could you share them on your socials, or print them out to place in your office?</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Download the</span> <span style=\"color: #76bc43;\"><a href=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/Emails/Welcome%20to%20DaVinci%20Posts.zip\" style=\"color: #76bc43;\" rel=\"noopener\">posts for my practice.</a></span></p>\n<ul></ul>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
