   "module_16783039699149": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; line-height: 175%;\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">What to Expect in the Future!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Finally, let's set the stage for what you can expect from us moving forward. Each month over the next few months, we will email you information to help you take full advantage of your partnership.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Each email will be focused on a specific topic. It could be information about the importance of cardio and how to support an active lifestyle, or it might be focused on a particular body function, such as bone health or sleep support. For each topic, we will share an article or informational post that you can directly share on your socials, include in emails, or add to your website to spread awareness with your patients. We will also include a selection of our supplements directly related to the topic. If a patient expresses interest, you can provide extra support. Stay tuned to see what exciting info we have to share!&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">That's it for now. We hope you are as excited to partner with us as we are! We look forward to working with you and providing support for your practice!&nbsp; Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions.</span></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
